==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Chun-Li (Enemy)|Chun-Li]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

